 "_doc": "Every check the repository has, once (David, 2026-10-27: one standard set; each merge runs the ones its change needs). tools/select-checks.js picks from this list by the files a change touches, and tools/run-checks.js runs them, in CI and locally. kind: unit (no browser), browser (Playwright), visual (tools/visualcheck.js, split by width). secs: its time on the CI runner (2026-10-27), used only to balance the browser shards. always: run on every change, whatever it touches. A check script in tools/ that is not listed here fails tools/selectcheck.js, so none can be left out.",
